	)
	(text "BOTTOM side, theta = 270 deg, long axis radial (X tangential). Put the Hall element, not the\npackage centre, on R_t = 29.0 mm: per TI Fig 6-2 it sits 0.40 mm from the body centre toward\nthe pin-3/4 end and 0.12 mm toward the pin 1-3 side (footprint coords -0.12, +0.40 mm).\nCaps next to pin 4. No pours/inductors within the magnet-track keep-out."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 24.13 0)
